The code in this directory is from multiple chapters of http://www.siam.org/books/ot134 
Numerical Computing with Modern Fortran Richard J.Hanson and Tim Hopkins SIAM, specifically 2,4,6,11 and 12

Code related to using superLU is based on the code from Chapter12. Code from ealier chapters, ie. set_precision.f90 and
LapackInterface.f90 are modified slightly from the original versions in the text.

Code from Chapter 11 has patches presented here:

The patches allow the code to be compatible with version > 5 of the SuperLU package, the original source from Chapter 11 of H&H
was compatible with version 4.3  An additional patch was also added for cmake build compatibility.

